OL,3,GNEWSAPerson injured as car crashes into
OL,4,Aestate agents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been left with
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries after a car
OL,8,Fthey were a passenger in crashed into a
OL,9,Ftown centre shopfront.
OL,11,FThe vehicle smashed into the Longsons
OL,12,Festate agents branch on Watton's High
OL,13,FStreet shortly before 23:00 GMT on
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FThe driver of the car - a black Kia
OL,17,FMagentis - was also freed by fire
OL,18,Fcrews. Norfolk Police said the two men,
OL,19,Faged in their 30s and 40s, were taken
OL,20,Fto the Norfolk and Norwich University
OL,21,FHospital.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
