OL,3,GNEWSAPerson injured as car crashes into
OL,4,Aestate agents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said the road was
OL,7,Fclosed at its junction with Dereham
OL,8,FRoad and would remain shut "for some
OL,9,Ftime". The "structural integrity" of
OL,10,Fthe building was being assessed, they
OL,11,Fadded.
